      <guid>//localhost:1313/1910/11/21/1132/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;postcard-2014-20140605_11433200_0492&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#34;//localhost:1313/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/postcard-2014-20140605_11433200_0492.jpg&#34;&gt; &lt;img alt=&#34;postcard-2014-20140605_11434637_0493&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#34;//localhost:1313/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/postcard-2014-20140605_11434637_0493.jpg&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;From: Pearl Ellis, To: Ruby Chandler&lt;br&gt;
Mailed From: Manchester, Illinois on November 21, 1910&lt;br&gt;
Postcard Info: “Thanksgiving” Series Number 926 Copyright 1910 A.S Meeker, NY&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Miss Ruby Chandler&lt;br&gt;
Pearl, Illinois&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nov. 21-10&lt;br&gt;
Dear Ruby,&lt;br&gt;
I am sick in bed with grippe and will be out of school all week. I hair it like everything. I hope to hear from you soon.&lt;br&gt;
Lovingly,&lt;br&gt;
Pearl E.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
